---
// Community call-to-action component
---

<section class="community-cta">
  <div class="cta-content">
    <h2>加入社区</h2>
    <p>OpenGlass Hub 的社区入口：</p>
    <div class="cta-links">
      <span class="cta-link github disabled">
        GitHub Discussions（准备中）
      </span>
      <span class="cta-link discord disabled">
        Discord（准备中）
      </span>
      <span class="cta-link wechat disabled">
        微信群（准备中）
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .community-cta {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding: 2rem;
    background: rgba(17, 21, 39, 0.88);
    border-radius: 1.15rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(124, 181, 255, 0.12);
    box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(4, 8, 18, 0.22);
  }
  .cta-content h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
  }
  .cta-content p {
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .cta-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  .cta-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.72rem 1.1rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: background 0.15s, border-color 0.15s, transform 0.15s;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
  }
  .cta-link.discord {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border-color: rgba(124, 181, 255, 0.14);
    color: #dbeafe;
  }
  .cta-link.discord:not(.disabled):hover {
    border-color: rgba(124, 181, 255, 0.3);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }
  .cta-link.wechat {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border-color: rgba(124, 181, 255, 0.14);
    color: #dbeafe;
  }
  .cta-link.wechat:not(.disabled):hover {
    border-color: rgba(124, 181, 255, 0.3);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }
  .cta-link.github {
    background: #2563eb;
    border-color: #2563eb;
    color: #f8fafc;
  }
  .cta-link.github:hover {
    background: #1d4ed8;
    border-color: #1d4ed8;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }
  .cta-link.disabled {
    opacity: 0.7;
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }
</style>
